{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50183","headline":"幽渚云 · 丘爲","name":"幽渚云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠云在渚，无心去何从。\n（「何」下原卷衍「疑」字。\n）青连晚湖色，澹起秋烟客（容）[一]。\n（「客」，原卷作「容」，与王校合。\n）渡水上下白，归山深浅重，来爲巫峡女，去逐葛川龙。\n勿爲长幽滞，当飞第一峯。\n（[一]依王仲闻先生校。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}